{"id":"B1-L204","title":"Despite / although — introduction","cefr":"B1","level":"B1","unit":"B1-U12","focus":"Despite / although — introdução","targets":{"grammar":"Despite / although — introdução","pron":"Sentence stress","verbs":["succeed"],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["late bloomer","failed exam","early wake-up","friends’ laughter","slow success","small village","stubborn will","final result","proud family","exam hall","study lamp","school story","difficult path","inner fire","second attempt","exam pass","success","too small"],"field":"Sentimentos e decisões","genre":"Conto e trecho de peça","skill":"Escuta","words_min":18},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 204 · Despite / although — introduction","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Despite / although — introdução.","**Verbos:** succeed.","**Pronúncia:** Sentence stress.","**18 palavras novas** (sentimentos e decisões).","**Texto do dia:** conto e trecho de peça."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (B1):** eu consigo contrastar ideias com despite, in spite of, although e even though num conto e usar succeed."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["","Esta aula treina **ouvir e anotar informações (IELTS Listening, TOEFL Listening)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["late bloomer","quem floresce tarde"],["failed exam","prova reprovada"],["early wake-up","acordar cedo"],["friends’ laughter","riso dos amigos"],["slow success","sucesso lento"],["small village","vilarejo pequeno"],["stubborn will","vontade teimosa"],["final result","resultado final"],["proud family","família orgulhosa"],["exam hall","sala de prova"],["study lamp","luminária de estudo"],["school story","história escolar"],["difficult path","caminho difícil"],["inner fire","fogo interior"],["second attempt","segunda tentativa"],["exam pass","aprovação"],["success","success"],["too small","too small"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · A short story","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"The Late Bloomer","paras":["**Although** Tomás failed his first exam, he kept studying. **Despite** feeling tired, he woke up early every day. **Even though** friends laughed, he never gave up.","**In spite of** the difficulties, he **succeeded**. “Success isn’t fast,” he said, “but it **is** possible.”"],"kicker":"SHORT STORY","by":"Original story","gloss":[]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Tomás failed his first exam.","ans":"T","why":"failed his first exam."},{"q":"Friends encouraged him.","ans":"F","why":"laughed."},{"q":"Tomás succeeded in the end.","ans":"T","why":"succeeded."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“although” = ?","opts":["embora","além disso","por isso"],"ans":0,"why":"although."},{"q":"“despite” = ?","opts":["apesar de","desprezar só","depois de"],"ans":0,"why":"despite."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Contraste: although / despite","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Conector","Seguido de","Exemplo"],"rows":[["although / even though","sujeito + verbo","**Although he failed, he kept studying.**"],["despite / in spite of","substantivo ou -ing","**Despite feeling tired, he studied.**"],["despite the fact that","oração","**Despite the fact that he failed,…**"],["however","nova frase","**He failed. However, he kept going.**"]],"cap":"Contraste: although / despite"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"**Despite** não leva *of*: ✗ *despite of*. **In spite of** leva *of*."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"___ he failed, he kept studying. (Although)","a":"Although","why":"+ oração."},{"s":"___ feeling tired, he woke early. (Despite)","a":"Despite","why":"+ -ing."},{"s":"___ of the difficulties, he succeeded. (In spite)","a":"In spite","why":"in spite of."},{"s":"Even ___ friends laughed, he went on. (though)","a":"though","why":"even though."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["late bloomer","quem floresce tarde"],["failed exam","prova reprovada"],["early wake-up","acordar cedo"],["friends’ laughter","riso dos amigos"],["study routine","rotina de estudo"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["I","succeeded","And"],"ans":"And I succeeded","pt":"E consegui."},{"words":["though","people","laughed","Even"],"ans":"Even though people laughed","pt":"Mesmo que as pessoas rissem!"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"late bloomer","pos":"word","pt":"quem floresce tarde","ex":"Late bloomer.","expt":"Quem floresce tarde."},{"w":"failed exam","pos":"word","pt":"prova reprovada","ex":"Failed exam.","expt":"Prova reprovada."},{"w":"early wake-up","pos":"word","pt":"acordar cedo","ex":"Early wake-up.","expt":"Acordar cedo."},{"w":"friends’ laughter","pos":"word","pt":"riso dos amigos","ex":"Friends’ laughter.","expt":"Riso dos amigos."},{"w":"slow success","pos":"word","pt":"sucesso lento","ex":"Slow success.","expt":"Sucesso lento."},{"w":"small village","pos":"word","pt":"vilarejo pequeno","ex":"Small village.","expt":"Vilarejo pequeno."},{"w":"stubborn will","pos":"word","pt":"vontade teimosa","ex":"Stubborn will.","expt":"Vontade teimosa."},{"w":"final result","pos":"word","pt":"resultado final","ex":"Final result.","expt":"Resultado final."},{"w":"proud family","pos":"word","pt":"família orgulhosa","ex":"Proud family.","expt":"Família orgulhosa."},{"w":"exam hall","pos":"word","pt":"sala de prova","ex":"Exam hall.","expt":"Sala de prova."},{"w":"study lamp","pos":"word","pt":"luminária de estudo","ex":"Study lamp.","expt":"Luminária de estudo."},{"w":"school story","pos":"word","pt":"história escolar","ex":"School story.","expt":"História escolar."},{"w":"difficult path","pos":"word","pt":"caminho difícil","ex":"Difficult path.","expt":"Caminho difícil."},{"w":"inner fire","pos":"word","pt":"fogo interior","ex":"Inner fire.","expt":"Fogo interior."},{"w":"second attempt","pos":"word","pt":"segunda tentativa","ex":"Second attempt.","expt":"Segunda tentativa."},{"w":"exam pass","pos":"word","pt":"aprovação","ex":"Exam pass.","expt":"Aprovação."},{"w":"success","pos":"word","pt":"success","ex":"sucesso","expt":"A real success."},{"w":"too small","pos":"word","pt":"too small","ex":"pequeno demais","expt":"The shirt is too small."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Better late than never.** — Antes tarde do que nunca.","**Slow and steady wins the race.** — Devagar e sempre.","**Against all odds.** — Contra tudo.","**Never say die.** — Nunca desista.","**Although you failed, you kept going.** — Embora tenha reprovado, você continuou.","**Despite feeling tired, I studied every day.** — Apesar de cansado, estudei todo dia.","**Even though people laughed!** — Mesmo que as pessoas rissem!","**Throw caution to the wind.** — Arriscar tudo."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"succeed","pt":"ter sucesso","forms":[["I / you / we / they succeed","He succeeded in the end."],["he / she / it succeeds","Ele teve sucesso no fim."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Encouragement","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Encouragement","lines":[["Ana","Although you failed, you kept going.","Embora tenha reprovado, você continuou."],["Tomás","Despite feeling tired, I studied every day.","Apesar de cansado, estudei todo dia."],["Ana","Even though people laughed!","Mesmo que as pessoas rissem!"],["Tomás","And I succeeded.","E consegui."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Sentence stress","items":[{"label":"Sentence stress","note":"Na frase, acentue palavras de conteúdo (substantivos, verbos, adjetivos) e reduza as funcionais: I WANT to LEARN ENglish.","words":["I want to learn English.","She has studied for years.","Can you help me?"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Use although.","pt":"Use.","model":"Although it rained, we went out."},{"q":"Use despite + -ing.","pt":"Use.","model":"Despite being tired, I studied."},{"q":"Use in spite of.","pt":"Use.","model":"In spite of the rain, we went."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences with although / despite / even though / in spite of.","model":"Although Tomás failed, he kept studying. Despite feeling tired, he woke up early. Even though friends laughed, he never gave up. In spite of the difficulties, he succeeded. Success is slow, but it is possible.","checklist":["Usei **although/despite/even though/in spite of**","5 frases"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “late bloomer” mean?","opts":["prova reprovada","riso dos amigos","quem floresce tarde"],"ans":2,"why":"**late bloomer** = quem floresce tarde."},{"q":"What does “failed exam” mean?","opts":["prova reprovada","acordar cedo","rotina de estudo"],"ans":0,"why":"**failed exam** = prova reprovada."},{"q":"What does “early wake-up” mean?","opts":["riso dos amigos","acordar cedo","trabalho duro"],"ans":1,"why":"**early wake-up** = acordar cedo."},{"q":"What does “friends’ laughter” mean?","opts":["rotina de estudo","sucesso lento","riso dos amigos"],"ans":2,"why":"**friends’ laughter** = riso dos amigos."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}